1268	sparkling__ruflo-patch	R216	After spawning agents, stop and wait for the results.
1269	sparkling__ruflo-patch	R217	Do not poll agent status after spawning agents.
1270	sparkling__ruflo-patch	R218	When you need a capability, choose tools in the listed order and stop at the first match.
